  "title": "· New Bags | Saint Laurent Debuts Winter 2026 Handbag Collection: Cozy Shearling ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Saint Laurent 上架2026冬季系列手袋：温暖羊剪绒",
  "excerpt": "Saint Laurent’s Winter 2026 bags feature plush shearling on the Icare tote, Jamie shopper, and Niki shoulder bag, blending languid allure with rebellion.",
