      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent has just unveiled its new bags for the Winter 2026 collection, and this season's pieces are built around warm, plush shearling. The Icare tote, Jamie shopper and Niki shoulder bag are all dressed in fuzzy fur coats, striking a mood that is languid and alluring yet unmistakably rebellious.",
