    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Icare tote is crafted in deep brown shearling, and its oversized silhouette delivers a warm, enveloping carry that brings a soothing note to winter dressing. The bronze-tone YSL Cassandre metal logo is set into the soft, fluffy shearling and remains the most eye-catching focal point.",
