    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Jamie bag takes its design cue from the dust bag, featuring a drawstring closure and a sliding-chain strap. The large shopper is made from deep hazelnut shearling, its extra-long wool lending an elegant, captivating air. The small shoulder bag comes in caramel shearling, with closely cropped shearling embossed in the Rive Gauche Carré check pattern for a vintage flavor.",
