      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Niki Shopper pairs a roomy horizontal tote shape with a double-strap design. Its vintage calfskin body is finished with V-shaped topstitching and a bronze-tone YSL Cassandre logo, while milk-tea shearling trims the edges like chestnut-flavored piped cream, adding a comforting touch to the bag.",
